/-!
# Stage 5 kernel check of [LAM], the exponent rows R1, R1b, R2, R3 and the controls K1-K8 (generated by `gen_stage5.py`)

`E_*`: every layer kappa in [0, 1] is served by a menu design whose P3, P4, P6 are at most the claim, and the
constant terms are too; `K*`: the must-fail controls of `cert_stage5.py`, each proved false.
-/

set_option maxRecDepth 100000
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

open Real

